1 0 0 1 108.00 720.00 Tm
(EXT. RIDGE ROAD - DAY) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 696.00 Tm
(Wind comes down off the ridge in long flat gusts, pushing) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 684.00 Tm
(the grass one way and then, for no reason, the other.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 660.00 Tm
(A road climbs the ridge in switchbacks. Nobody has driven it) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 648.00 Tm
(since the washout, and the grass is taking it back.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 624.00 Tm
(MARA, 40s, walks it with a pack on and four days in her) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 612.00 Tm
(legs. She has the face of someone who fixes things and is) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 600.00 Tm
(never thanked.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 576.00 Tm
(DELACROIX, 50s, walks behind her with a paper map folded to) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 564.00 Tm
(the right square. He does not look at it. He looks at the) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 552.00 Tm
(road, and counts.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 528.00 Tm
(DELACROIX) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 516.00 Tm
(Thirty-one.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 492.00 Tm
(They take the bend. Gravel lets go under Mara's boot and) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 480.00 Tm
(goes quietly over the edge.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 456.00 Tm
(MARA) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 444.00 Tm
(You don't have to do that out loud.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 420.00 Tm
(DELACROIX) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 408.00 Tm
(The map says forty. I'd like to) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 396.00 Tm
(know when it's lying.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 372.00 Tm
(Cloud sits on the ridge above them like a lid somebody) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 360.00 Tm
(forgot to close.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 336.00 Tm
(MARA) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 324.00 Tm
(How long has he been up there?) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 300.00 Tm
(DELACROIX) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 288.00 Tm
(Three weeks. On his own.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 264.00 Tm
(MARA) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 252.00 Tm
(They said two.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 228.00 Tm
(DELACROIX) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 216.00 Tm
(They say a lot of things.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 192.00 Tm
(The road ends at the washout, a bite taken out of the) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 180.00 Tm
(mountain. Mara stops where the road stops, then goes round) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 168.00 Tm
(it on the rock.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 144.00 Tm
(DELACROIX) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 132.00 Tm
(Thirty-eight.) Tj
ET
endstream
