1 0 0 1 180.00 216.00 Tm
(it.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 192.00 Tm
(MARA) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 180.00 Tm
(Do you?) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 156.00 Tm
(TEO) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 144.00 Tm
(No.) Tj
