(3.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 720.00 Tm
(Teo walks them round the station at a pace that makes it) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 708.00 Tm
(hard to see any of it.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 684.00 Tm
(TEO) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 672.00 Tm
