1 0 0 1 108.00 408.00 Tm
(the housing, old and new. One bolt is missing. Another turns) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 396.00 Tm
(in her fingers with no thread left to hold it.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 372.00 Tm
(She looks at it for a long moment. Then she lets the tarp) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 360.00 Tm
(fall.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 336.00 Tm
(DELACROIX) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 324.00 Tm
(Well?) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 300.00 Tm
(MARA) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 288.00 Tm
(It runs.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 264.00 Tm
(That is all she says. Delacroix has worked with her long) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 252.00 Tm
(enough to count what she leaves out.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 228.00 Tm
(TEO) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 216.00 Tm
(I kept it running. Every day. I) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 204.00 Tm
(wrote it down.) Tj
1 0 0 1 266.40 180.00 Tm
(MARA) Tj
1 0 0 1 180.00 168.00 Tm
(I believe you.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 144.00 Tm
