(EXT. RIDGE - NIGHT) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 696.00 Tm
(Wind, and under the wind a cold that means business.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 672.00 Tm
(DELACROIX walks the ridge with a torch, the beam no use) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 660.00 Tm
(against anything further off than his own boots.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 636.00 Tm
(He finds the marker cairn where the map says it will be: a) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 624.00 Tm
(chest-high stack of flat stones, sighted down the valley) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 612.00 Tm
(toward the fourth station. In clear weather you could see) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 600.00 Tm
(its lamp from here.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 576.00 Tm
(There is no lamp tonight. There is no clear weather.) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.00 552.00 Tm
